### Racinglazing ForumService — smoke test requests
### In development, ForumAuth:AllowDevHeaders = true, so identity comes from headers.

@base = http://localhost:5080
@userId = user-123
@modId = mod-1

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### List categories
GET {{base}}/api/v1/categories

### List forums (grab a forumId from the response for the calls below)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/forums

# @name createThread
### Create a thread (replace {forumId})
POST {{base}}/api/v1/forums/{forumId}/threads
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "title": "Why is Ferrari struggling with tyre degradation?",
  "content": { "text": "Why does Ferrari seem to struggle so much with tyre deg?" },
  "tags": ["ferrari", "strategy"],
  "raceId": null
}

### Get thread detail (replace {threadId})
GET {{base}}/api/v1/threads/{threadId}
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### List threads in a forum, hot
GET {{base}}/api/v1/forums/{forumId}/threads?sort=hot&pageSize=20
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### Create a top-level comment
POST {{base}}/api/v1/threads/{threadId}/comments
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: user-456

{ "content": { "text": "I think it's tyre temperature management." } }

### Vote a thread up
PUT {{base}}/api/v1/threads/{threadId}/vote
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{ "vote": "up" }

### List comments (top)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/threads/{threadId}/comments?sort=top

### Report a comment
POST {{base}}/api/v1/reports
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: user-789

{ "targetType": "comment", "targetId": "{commentId}", "reason": "spam", "description": "ad" }

### Moderator: list reports (needs a moderator role)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/moderation/reports?status=pending
X-User-Id: {{modId}}
X-User-Roles: moderator

### Pin a thread (moderator)
PUT {{base}}/api/v1/threads/{threadId}/pin
X-User-Id: {{modId}}
X-User-Roles: moderator

### Tags search
GET {{base}}/api/v1/tags?search=ferr

### Threads by tag
GET {{base}}/api/v1/tags/ferrari/threads?sort=new
